WEBVTT

00:01.300 --> 00:08.290
<i>Can you imagine a life where you 
can't even touch the person you love?</i>

00:09.120 --> 00:14.160
<i>The curse the witch laid upon him caused 
him to take the lives of any he touched.</i>

00:14.820 --> 00:19.070
<i>His own mother distanced herself from him,
 his friends called him a monster...</i>

00:19.070 --> 00:20.400
<i>Even people he'd never met spoke of him as</i>

00:20.400 --> 00:23.490
<i>"death incarnate that dwells in the forest."</i>

00:24.170 --> 00:29.160
<i>And yet, he doesn't feel 
the least bit lonely.</i>

02:00.010 --> 02:03.720
Episode 23
The Duke, Alice, and the Wizardry School

02:01.840 --> 02:03.720
Wizardry school...

02:04.350 --> 02:06.930
I didn't know there was such a thing.

02:07.170 --> 02:09.910
Cuff and Zain said they were going.

02:09.910 --> 02:11.830
What about you?

02:11.830 --> 02:13.220
Of course, I'm going.

02:13.220 --> 02:16.420
I'll go anywhere if it'll 
help break the curse.

02:16.420 --> 02:21.310
I agree with Nico's plan to go back 
into the past with Zain's magic, too.

02:21.310 --> 02:22.160
But...

02:23.080 --> 02:25.670
...and kill Sade again.

02:27.360 --> 02:29.750
I don't want to kill Sade.

02:30.410 --> 02:32.800
I want to talk with him about that.

02:32.800 --> 02:34.580
I'll go with you.

02:34.580 --> 02:35.970
I'll be glad to have you with me.

02:35.970 --> 02:38.760
I feel bad that Rob has to stay home, though.

02:40.570 --> 02:44.220
They'll teach us about magic 
and witches at the school, too.

02:45.140 --> 02:49.330
If I'm going to be friends with Sade, 
I want to know about those things, too.

02:49.330 --> 02:50.100
Yes.

02:50.100 --> 02:55.570
And more than anything, I'm happy 
I'll get to go to school with you.

02:55.570 --> 02:57.450
<i>She's so cute!</i>

03:01.870 --> 03:03.030
What's wrong?

03:03.710 --> 03:05.740
It's got something about Sade.

03:06.840 --> 03:08.250
That's my mother's handwriting.

03:08.250 --> 03:09.450
Sharon wrote this?

03:09.450 --> 03:10.460
"Whassup!"

03:10.460 --> 03:12.710
"It's me, Sharon, and I'm on 
journal duty for the day!"

03:13.150 --> 03:17.640
<i>Sade came to the mansion today, 
so we talked for a little!</i>

03:17.640 --> 03:22.680
<i>She's a nun, but she knows all about 
fortune-telling and feng-shui!</i>

03:22.680 --> 03:26.580
"Sade was able to tell me everything 
about my past and what I was thinking,

03:26.580 --> 03:30.320
and I was like, 'Wow, are you, 
like, psychic or something?'"

03:30.320 --> 03:30.950
The end.

03:30.950 --> 03:34.650
It's less like a servant's journal 
and more like her own picture diary.

03:35.020 --> 03:36.570
That's just like my mother.

03:36.570 --> 03:40.530
But from the sound of it, 
she and Sade were friends.

03:40.530 --> 03:41.420
Yeah.

03:41.420 --> 03:45.100
But Sharon was cursed, and put to sleep...

03:46.710 --> 03:48.540
There's not much else here.

03:48.970 --> 03:52.850
What in this did Daleth want to hide?

03:53.790 --> 03:55.840
You're close! You're always close!

03:55.840 --> 03:58.590
You looked so handsome when 
you were lost in thought.

03:58.590 --> 04:01.320
You don't know how much that scares me!

04:01.320 --> 04:04.020
I still can't guess what you're 
going to do sometimes.

04:05.510 --> 04:10.980
<i>Sade was able to tell me everything 
about my past and what I was thinking.</i>

04:12.170 --> 04:14.940
<i>Nico said the same thing...</i>

04:15.330 --> 04:19.190
<i>That Sade knew everything 
they were going to do.</i>

04:20.000 --> 04:23.650
<i>Maybe Sade can read minds?</i>

04:24.680 --> 04:26.210
<i>It's possible.</i>

04:26.210 --> 04:27.960
<i>She's a magical genius.</i>

04:28.390 --> 04:34.620
<i>Maybe she read minds, 
just like Zain can control time.</i>

04:35.150 --> 04:37.550
<i>I'll ask Daleth.</i>

04:37.920 --> 04:41.590
<i>If she was that powerful with 
magic and could read minds...</i>

04:42.080 --> 04:43.590
<i>Yes, she'd be unstoppable.</i>

04:45.070 --> 04:47.300
<i>Really... I can't guess 
what she'll do at all!</i>

04:50.510 --> 04:53.480
Eldest Son, next it's your 
turn to end up like that!

04:53.920 --> 04:55.620
Shiver as you go to bed tonight!

04:57.390 --> 04:58.890
He really is wonderful!

04:58.890 --> 05:00.270
How ya figure?

05:00.270 --> 05:01.800
He's such a gentleman!

05:01.800 --> 05:03.360
How, though?

05:04.080 --> 05:06.900
Daleth, you're the boss of us witches!

05:06.900 --> 05:11.300
If you like him, go talk to him!

05:11.300 --> 05:13.370
He wouldn't want to talk 
to an ugly girl like me.

05:13.650 --> 05:14.830
You're not ugly.

05:15.410 --> 05:16.430
It's fine.

05:16.430 --> 05:19.670
I'm happy just watching him 
from afar, like I said.

05:19.670 --> 05:22.050
As for you, drink muddy water, 
get sick to your stomach, and die.

05:22.050 --> 05:24.990
Stop being mean to just your friends.

05:24.990 --> 05:27.010
What are you doing there?

05:27.380 --> 05:28.470
His sister!

05:28.470 --> 05:30.290
Sister?

05:33.430 --> 05:35.080
Stop standing in the snow.

05:35.080 --> 05:37.290
If you want to talk to him, come inside.

05:37.290 --> 05:38.650
It's cold!

05:38.650 --> 05:41.820
I-I'm just here because I don't 
have anything better to do.

05:42.200 --> 05:44.530
If you don't have anything 
to do, come play with me.

05:49.770 --> 05:52.920
So you were watching my 
dear brother Walter after all, then.

05:52.920 --> 05:54.410
You've got terrible taste.

05:55.030 --> 05:56.470
What's your name?

05:56.470 --> 05:57.370
Daleth...

05:57.370 --> 05:59.540
You're a strange one, Daleth.

05:59.540 --> 06:02.540
I can't figure out what you'd like about him.

06:02.540 --> 06:05.010
Well, he's got a handsome face, sorta.

06:05.910 --> 06:07.510
<i>Why am I sticking up for him?</i>

06:07.510 --> 06:09.110
Ridiculous.

06:09.110 --> 06:12.470
He needs another half-century 
to mature, at a minimum.

06:12.470 --> 06:14.520
You're weirder than she is.

06:14.920 --> 06:18.010
I should've asked this sooner, 
but what are you doing to me?

06:18.010 --> 06:20.020
Help me practice my makeup.

06:20.260 --> 06:22.140
And let me cut your hair.

06:22.140 --> 06:24.400
You'll be even cuter, I promise.

06:25.020 --> 06:28.080
You came all this way to 
see my brother, right?

06:28.080 --> 06:29.860
You want to be confident when you see him.

06:37.150 --> 06:39.460
Daleth, do you not like your face?

06:40.270 --> 06:41.590
They never disappear.

06:41.590 --> 06:44.170
The scars on my face... I don't like them.

06:44.170 --> 06:47.880
Gotcha. We'll hide them 
with some foundation, then.

06:48.330 --> 06:51.640
Stop, Sade! It hurts!

06:51.640 --> 06:53.350
It hurts!

06:54.990 --> 06:57.430
Don't be so nervous, Daleth.

06:57.430 --> 06:59.770
I can't put on the makeup unless you're calm.

07:13.950 --> 07:15.700
Dear Brother Walter!

07:15.700 --> 07:18.220
You have someone who wants to talk to you!

07:18.220 --> 07:20.410
You don't have to do this!

07:21.120 --> 07:22.580
Oh, Daleth!

07:22.580 --> 07:25.070
I was just thinking up new 
nasty names for the eldest!

07:25.070 --> 07:26.250
Want to hear them?

07:27.160 --> 07:28.630
I-I'm going home.

07:28.630 --> 07:29.470
You piece of garbage!

07:29.470 --> 07:30.380
Wh-Why?

07:33.930 --> 07:36.050
Have a nice day, Walter.

07:37.930 --> 07:39.770
Garbage! Trash! Moron!

07:40.140 --> 07:42.370
Your mom's flat!

07:42.370 --> 07:43.730
She was smiling...

07:46.190 --> 07:47.230
Delicious!

07:47.230 --> 07:49.710
Your cakes are always the best, Alice!

07:49.710 --> 07:51.370
Thank you.

07:51.370 --> 07:53.720
Hey, when are we girls having our next party?

07:53.720 --> 07:55.730
You know when the circus is gonna be closed?

07:55.730 --> 07:57.870
I'll ask Cuff.

07:57.870 --> 08:00.940
There's actually someone 
else who's asked to join.

08:00.940 --> 08:02.460
Sure, glad to have them!

08:02.820 --> 08:06.050
<i>Nico said I could invite anybody I wanted,</i>

08:06.050 --> 08:08.960
<i>but I couldn't ask Viola to come, right?</i>

08:10.600 --> 08:12.970
Your hands are so soft!

08:12.970 --> 08:15.640
I could rub them forever!

08:15.640 --> 08:18.410
<i>Just having her nearby 
would make me feel better.</i>

08:18.410 --> 08:20.390
<i>But I don't want to put her in danger.</i>

08:21.530 --> 08:25.130
Maybe I'll just rub her breasts instead!

08:24.160 --> 08:27.360
<i>And she'd need mother's permission 
to leave the house...</i>

08:27.360 --> 08:32.800
Brother! If you don't stop me like you 
usually do, I really will touch them!

08:32.800 --> 08:34.490
What?

08:34.490 --> 08:36.010
Go ahead, Viola.

08:36.010 --> 08:37.910
They're so soft! Thank you!

08:38.490 --> 08:40.080
You're acting super suspicious.

08:40.080 --> 08:42.410
You're hiding something, aren't you, Brother?

08:42.630 --> 08:44.620
No, nothing...

08:44.620 --> 08:45.620
Over there?

08:47.290 --> 08:48.840
This looks suspicious!

08:48.840 --> 08:50.590
How is she so sharp?

08:50.590 --> 08:52.180
Viola is impressive.

08:52.180 --> 08:55.300
Let me see what you're hiding!

08:56.940 --> 08:58.510
A skirt? Why?

08:59.010 --> 09:01.970
This is cute! What is it?

09:01.970 --> 09:04.630
This is... my secret hobby!

09:04.630 --> 09:06.850
I was going to wear it myself!

09:07.240 --> 09:08.940
<i>Hopefully that works!</i>

09:11.070 --> 09:14.520
Don't worry. I'm understanding 
about that stuff.

09:14.520 --> 09:15.700
You don't have to wear it in secret.

09:15.700 --> 09:17.240
I didn't expect that!

09:17.240 --> 09:18.480
Hey!

09:18.480 --> 09:22.790
I wanted to ask how many snacks we 
can take to the wizardry... school?

09:22.790 --> 09:24.610
Wizardry school?

09:24.610 --> 09:25.620
Um, you see..

09:29.600 --> 09:32.050
I want to go too!

09:32.050 --> 09:36.050
I want to go to Wizardry 
School and wear this uniform!

09:36.050 --> 09:38.080
W-We're not going to have fun!

09:38.080 --> 09:40.140
We're going to help break my curse!

09:40.140 --> 09:41.960
I don't care why!

09:41.960 --> 09:45.230
I'd do anything for a chance to 
get away from home for a while!

09:45.230 --> 09:46.410
Is that why?

09:46.410 --> 09:49.560
I'll go ask Rob if I look 
good in this uniform!

09:51.020 --> 09:52.000
Sorry.

09:52.000 --> 09:54.220
I didn't realize Viola was here.

09:54.220 --> 09:55.610
Don't worry.

09:55.610 --> 09:57.690
It might be better than leaving 
without saying anything.

09:57.690 --> 09:58.910
If you say so...

09:59.520 --> 10:04.620
We'll have to tell her about Zain 
and me being witches soon, too.

10:26.930 --> 10:29.670
I can't believe we got a 
whole car to ourselves.

10:29.670 --> 10:31.620
We're using our power as nobles.

10:31.620 --> 10:35.050
We can't have Dear Brother in the same 
car as the other passengers, right?

10:35.050 --> 10:38.060
If we've got the whole car to ourselves, 
we're allowed to dance, right?

10:38.060 --> 10:39.610
Just do it where I can't see you two.

10:40.350 --> 10:43.190
Thanks for setting all this up for us, Viola.

10:43.190 --> 10:45.580
I didn't think Walter would 
want to come too, though!

10:45.990 --> 10:47.280
I told you!

10:47.280 --> 10:50.170
I'm going to find the truth 
of the curse before you do!

10:50.170 --> 10:53.320
And I want information on 
witches too! That's all!

10:54.030 --> 10:58.850
Mom said if I wanted to 
go, I had to take him.

10:58.850 --> 11:03.010
It's like a grand tour, 
I guess. She's paying for it.

11:03.010 --> 11:05.240
What's a grand tour?

11:05.240 --> 11:09.590
It's a tradition where noble children 
go on a tour to learn about the world.

11:09.590 --> 11:12.790
I'm glad mom was understanding.

11:17.580 --> 11:19.360
Where are they going, I wonder?

11:19.700 --> 11:21.830
Just a trip, I'd imagine.

11:21.830 --> 11:26.080
You didn't need to use perfume to hide 
your magic so you could follow them.

11:26.080 --> 11:27.060
Yes I did.

11:27.060 --> 11:28.920
I'm worried about Walter.

11:28.920 --> 11:31.290
You're turning into a real stalker.

11:32.000 --> 11:34.130
You can go back by yourself if you like.

11:34.130 --> 11:37.170
Nope! I'm one of Daleth's girls!

11:38.380 --> 11:39.720
That's such an awful name.

11:41.260 --> 11:43.430
So you're witches?

11:43.430 --> 11:45.860
Sorry we didn't tell you.

11:45.860 --> 11:49.370
We didn't tell you because we 
didn't want to get you involved.

11:50.230 --> 11:51.850
It's not a surprise, though.

11:51.850 --> 11:54.440
Cuff came in through a second 
story window the other day.

11:54.670 --> 11:56.690
So, what kind of magic can you use?

11:56.690 --> 11:59.060
This is what I'm best at.

12:00.630 --> 12:02.360
That's so cool!

12:08.370 --> 12:10.500
Have you never been on a train before, Alice?

12:10.500 --> 12:14.280
Not since Rob brought me to the mansion.

12:14.280 --> 12:18.010
But this is even more special than that trip.

12:18.340 --> 12:21.150
I still can't believe I get 
to go on a trip with you.

12:21.560 --> 12:22.970
M-Me, too!

13:18.750 --> 13:20.550
So this is it?

13:21.380 --> 13:24.990
Hey! We've been waiting for you!

13:25.580 --> 13:28.460
<i>So this is the wizardry school...</i>

13:33.780 --> 13:35.660
I'll introduce the two of us again.

13:36.620 --> 13:38.520
I'm Nico, the headmaster.

13:38.860 --> 13:41.870
And this beautiful lady is 
Assistant Headmaster Ichi.

13:41.870 --> 13:44.630
We'll teach you all you need to know 
about magic, wizardry, and witches.

13:44.630 --> 13:46.930
That includes both practical
 training and book learning.

13:47.190 --> 13:49.640
Beautiful? Ichi?

13:49.870 --> 13:53.720
Show some respect, or I'll rip off your beak!

13:54.600 --> 13:57.480
You will address us as teachers!

13:58.090 --> 14:01.060
And if you don't, I'll teach you a lesson!

14:01.060 --> 14:02.990
Haha, get it?

14:02.840 --> 14:07.170
<b>Hahahahaha</b>

14:02.990 --> 14:05.690
His immortality makes him look like a kid,

14:05.690 --> 14:07.720
but he's actually a senile old man.

14:07.720 --> 14:10.050
Go change into your uniforms.

14:10.050 --> 14:12.290
I'll show you around the school.

14:12.290 --> 14:13.590
Yay! Uniforms!

14:13.590 --> 14:14.540
Yay! Changing!

14:16.610 --> 14:18.500
It's so cute!

14:18.980 --> 14:21.610
I came here just to wear this!

14:23.170 --> 14:25.340
Wearing black feels awkward.

14:25.940 --> 14:28.840
Can I raise this skirt's hemline?

14:29.300 --> 14:31.850
It's so nice to have matching uniforms!

14:31.850 --> 14:33.520
You're so cute!

14:33.520 --> 14:36.590
I'm worried about having 
them as students here.

14:36.590 --> 14:38.310
Come on, it'll be fine.

14:40.320 --> 14:42.910
First, I'll introduce the upperclassmen.

14:42.910 --> 14:43.730
Come out.

14:47.610 --> 14:50.600
This is Sarah Sunroad. She's a great healer.

14:50.970 --> 14:52.870
Millie, who can cut anything.

14:52.870 --> 14:53.950
Hey!

14:53.950 --> 14:55.810
Pfeifer, who commands thunder.

14:55.810 --> 14:57.380
Hewwo!

14:57.380 --> 14:59.280
Evelyn, who can hide anywhere.

14:59.280 --> 15:00.420
Yo!

15:00.730 --> 15:01.540
That's all of them.

15:01.540 --> 15:02.520
Seriously?

15:02.520 --> 15:04.050
There really are girls!

15:04.050 --> 15:05.880
I told you I wasn't lying.

15:06.110 --> 15:07.370
Wait, is this all?

15:07.370 --> 15:10.760
You said you were rounding up comrades,
 but it's just these four?

15:10.760 --> 15:11.880
Shut up!

15:11.880 --> 15:14.720
It's hard to find people with magical power!

15:15.350 --> 15:17.680
And we built this huge school, too.

15:17.680 --> 15:19.620
It's been rough for us too, you know?

15:19.620 --> 15:22.100
I'll introduce the other instructor.

15:22.420 --> 15:24.530
He's also the one who'll be teaching you.

15:27.190 --> 15:28.450
You're...

15:28.450 --> 15:30.230
When I looked in the mirror this morning,

15:30.230 --> 15:33.240
I'd gotten another step closer 
to being like Brother Nico.

15:33.980 --> 15:37.090
I'm a man who admires Brother Nico
 and wants to be him!

15:37.090 --> 15:39.200
Hello! I'm your teacher, Flea!

15:40.510 --> 15:41.920
He's our teacher?

15:41.920 --> 15:44.190
You're so cool, Mister Flea!

15:44.190 --> 15:46.000
Give me your autograph!

15:46.490 --> 15:48.130
Why do the girls like <i>him</i>?

15:48.380 --> 15:51.500
And I can tell from your magical 
power that you're a witch!

15:51.500 --> 15:53.340
Why are you serving a human?

15:53.950 --> 15:57.870
I admire the way he and 
Ichi live their lives!

15:57.870 --> 16:01.690
People who care about race 
are behind the times.

16:01.690 --> 16:03.700
He's the best!

16:03.700 --> 16:05.150
I can't accept this!

16:06.270 --> 16:10.570
So we've shown you most of the school.

16:10.930 --> 16:12.750
Any questions?

16:12.750 --> 16:13.530
Yes.

16:14.860 --> 16:17.260
How long will these classes last?

16:17.260 --> 16:20.250
I've told my household it 
would take about a week.

16:20.530 --> 16:23.750
That'll cover the basics.

16:23.750 --> 16:25.590
After that, everyone's free to as they please.

16:25.920 --> 16:28.960
If you want to learn for a specific reason,
 you can stay here for a while.

16:33.010 --> 16:38.390
To defeat Sade, you'll need to be increasing 
your magical power and learning the basics.

16:38.390 --> 16:42.560
This way, you'll get strong enough to fight her.

16:42.560 --> 16:44.350
I want you all to study hard.

16:44.630 --> 16:47.940
Especially you, Zain. 
You're the key to this plan.

16:47.940 --> 16:51.740
I want you to be able to control 
your time magic perfectly.

16:51.740 --> 16:53.480
Got it.

16:53.480 --> 16:57.400
I'll be honest, I'm still 
not happy about helping you.

16:57.400 --> 17:00.140
But I want to help my friend.

17:00.140 --> 17:01.290
Zain...

17:02.080 --> 17:03.840
Classes start tomorrow.

17:03.840 --> 17:05.870
I've prepared food and a bath for you.

17:07.370 --> 17:09.320
Tonight, get some rest.

17:11.370 --> 17:12.170
Food!

17:12.170 --> 17:12.840
A bath!

17:13.930 --> 17:15.800
We ended up being very late.

17:16.400 --> 17:17.850
We suffered a horrible delay.

17:17.850 --> 17:20.010
You're very popular, Daleth.

17:20.010 --> 17:21.750
Now let's go inside.

17:22.090 --> 17:26.140
This building has a powerful 
barrier around it, though.

17:26.140 --> 17:27.470
Ow!

17:27.780 --> 17:29.310
I just told you...

17:29.970 --> 17:32.780
What does Walter want here?

17:33.400 --> 17:35.460
What if he came to see another woman?

17:35.460 --> 17:37.180
I don't think he did.

17:37.180 --> 17:39.230
No, I'm sure he did!

17:39.230 --> 17:42.310
If I could tear down this 
castle right now, I would!

17:46.680 --> 17:48.780
That was a great dinner, wasn't it?

17:49.170 --> 17:50.950
It was delicious.

17:50.950 --> 17:52.880
I'm glad we came.

17:52.880 --> 17:56.610
I still don't get this magic stuff,
 but it was fun.

17:56.610 --> 18:00.270
Viola, it's terrible manners to 
get into the bath with a towel on.

18:00.270 --> 18:00.600
Get rid of it!

18:02.450 --> 18:04.810
N-No way!

18:05.390 --> 18:07.990
<i>I just heard Viola's voice in the distance.</i>

18:07.990 --> 18:09.770
<i>Did something happen?</i>

18:11.150 --> 18:13.230
<i>This is awkward.</i>

18:13.230 --> 18:15.400
<i>Where did Zain go?</i>

18:16.240 --> 18:17.950
What are you doing here?

18:18.230 --> 18:20.850
Am I not allowed in the woman's bath?

18:20.850 --> 18:22.660
If anyone shouldn't be here, it's you.

18:22.660 --> 18:25.580
Oh, um, I thought this was the men's bath.

18:25.580 --> 18:27.870
It's on the other side of the 
building, you peeping cockerel!

18:29.020 --> 18:30.380
I want to ask you something.

18:30.630 --> 18:31.900
Wh-What is it?

18:31.900 --> 18:35.790
That man who looks like a child, Threeco...

18:35.790 --> 18:36.970
Isn't "Twoco" more apt?

18:36.970 --> 18:38.470
Don't ever say that!

18:38.930 --> 18:42.590
That less-than-threeco man was saying 
something about "Defeating Sade."

18:43.020 --> 18:45.410
But I didn't hear the full story.

18:45.410 --> 18:46.630
Explain.

18:46.630 --> 18:47.590
Okay.

18:47.590 --> 18:50.340
You've come this far so 
I'll explain everything.

18:54.580 --> 18:56.200
Isn't this fun, Alice?

18:56.200 --> 18:57.420
I'm so glad I came.

18:57.420 --> 18:58.650
Me, too.

19:00.350 --> 19:03.120
<i>There's no room for me to get between...</i>

19:03.120 --> 19:04.170
I see.

19:04.170 --> 19:06.740
So you'll use Zain's magic to go back in time

19:06.740 --> 19:10.050
and defeat Sade before she 
lays the curse on you.

19:11.320 --> 19:13.330
But I don't want to kill her.

19:14.070 --> 19:15.620
I want to talk to her.

19:15.620 --> 19:18.160
I want to know why she cursed me.

19:18.160 --> 19:22.020
I don't want to use force. 
I want to be friends with her.

19:22.020 --> 19:22.760
I understand.

19:24.560 --> 19:28.830
I was wondering... did Mom say 
anything about us coming here?

19:29.690 --> 19:31.630
I didn't tell her this was a wizardry school,

19:31.630 --> 19:33.300
but she didn't complain at all.

19:33.940 --> 19:36.730
She said she wanted me to go 
and learn more about the world.

19:36.730 --> 19:40.450
How are things with Mom lately?

19:41.210 --> 19:43.160
It's working out all right.

19:46.070 --> 19:48.370
<i>Walter's being nice today.</i>

19:48.710 --> 19:52.330
<i>A hot spring brings peace 
to the heart, I guess.</i>

19:53.270 --> 19:54.810
I'm sorry for making you go through all this.

19:54.810 --> 19:56.070
Shut up, loser!

20:00.860 --> 20:02.850
I don't know what'll set him off.

20:04.600 --> 20:07.690
That sight's too much for a girl 
who's not experienced with guys!

20:07.690 --> 20:09.890
Then don't look!

20:09.890 --> 20:11.640
So, what now?

20:12.330 --> 20:14.050
We'll watch a little more.

20:14.050 --> 20:17.940
Once the sun rises, 
I'll see just who this woman is.

20:17.940 --> 20:20.360
I'm pretty sure it's not 
another woman, though.

20:20.590 --> 20:22.820
So that's the story?

20:23.230 --> 20:27.020
I understand why Cuff wanted to 
come here after talking to you.

20:27.020 --> 20:30.630
She just wants to get stronger, I think.

20:30.630 --> 20:34.890
Though I'm sure you'd like to be 
the one who protects her forever.

20:37.350 --> 20:38.760
Believe in her.

20:38.760 --> 20:42.250
No matter how strong she gets, 
she's not going anywhere.

20:42.250 --> 20:43.480
I know.

20:44.020 --> 20:45.690
That was a great bath.

20:45.690 --> 20:46.180
Huh?

20:46.400 --> 20:48.220
Zain? Ms. Ichi?

20:48.220 --> 20:49.220
Hey, Cuff!

20:49.220 --> 20:51.780
This old lady's actually pretty 
neat once you get to know her!

20:51.780 --> 20:54.140
I guess I said more than I should have.

20:54.850 --> 20:55.940
Cuff, let's go.

20:56.370 --> 20:58.610
I'll train you every night, starting tonight.

20:58.920 --> 21:01.070
I'll make you strong.

21:12.220 --> 21:13.500
Your Grace...

21:13.500 --> 21:16.970
I came because I wanted to see how 
you were doing before I slept.

21:16.970 --> 21:17.930
Me, too.

21:17.930 --> 21:18.960
I'm glad I got to see you.

21:19.690 --> 21:21.420
Classes start tomorrow, right?

21:21.420 --> 21:22.400
Yes.

21:22.400 --> 21:26.130
It makes me happy to be your classmate.

21:30.720 --> 21:33.760
Now, I'm afraid Viola is waiting.

21:33.760 --> 21:35.350
Goodnight, Your Grace.

21:35.720 --> 21:37.220
Goodnight, Alice.

21:39.300 --> 21:40.060
A-And...

21:41.770 --> 21:45.990
You looked really cute in your uniform.

21:47.090 --> 21:51.010
Thank you. You looked 
wonderful too, Your Grace.

22:00.200 --> 22:01.840
I think I'm glad I came!

23:35.050 --> 23:40.250
The Duke of Death and His Maid
The Duke, Alice, and the Curse Witch

23:35.520 --> 23:39.650
"The Duke, Alice, and the Curse Witch."
